WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:04.340
At CIFAR, we see research differently.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.400
It's about more than proximity and disciplines

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.240
it's about asking the big questions

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:13.780
and assembling the right teams to find answers.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.880
Being bold and taking risks

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:21.140
supporting diverse researchers who achieve unprecedented advances

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.800
in life and health

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.400
for individuals and society

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.380
for earth and space

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.620
for information and matter

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.180
for the world.

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.180
We support the risk-takers.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:41.760
We enable big thinking.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:47.700
We bring together the brightest and boldest minds across academic disciplines

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.420
and across borders

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:53.240
to address science and humanity's most important questions.

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:55.680
Together we stay curious

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:02.700
and we will continue to provide researchers with the  time and freedom to explore new ideas.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:06.120
As we look to the future, we will work from this premise:

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.720
Fundamental research matters.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.460
Some of it changes what we know about the world today,

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:14.700
and some of it will change what we know centuries from now.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.820
All of it fuels innovation

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:19.020
and advanced humankind.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:20.500
Join us.

